---

### Step 3: Identify the Only Valid Pair

Only the pair $ (p, q) = (3, 97) $ satisfies the condition that $ p $ is a 1-digit prime, $ q $ is a 2-digit prime, and $ p + q = 100 $.

---

### Step 4: Compute the Product

$$
\text{Product} = 3 \times 97 = 291
$$

---

### Final Answer

$$
\boxed{291}
