Now the denominator is 3³ minus 3². 3³ is 27 again, and 3² is 9. So subtracting those gives 27 - 9. That equals 18. So the denominator is 18.

Now the problem simplifies to 54 divided by 18. Let me divide 54 by 18. Well, 18 times 3 is 54, so the result is 3. 

