This looks like the standard form of a parabola. The standard form of a parabola that opens upwards or downwards is $(x - h)^2 = 4p(y - k)$, where (h, k) is the vertex and p is the distance from the vertex to the focus. Comparing, here we have 4p = 2, so p = 0.5. Therefore, this is indeed a parabola opening upwards.

